    "A shiny, sticky film means sap-suckers like scale or aphids are nearby." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein glänzender, klebriger Film heißt: Saftsauger wie Schildläuse oder Blattläuse sind in der Nähe."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una capa brillante y pegajosa indica que hay chupadores de savia cerca, como cochinillas o pulgones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
