          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can spend most of the year outside in %@; bring it in on the coldest nights below %@." : {
      "comment" : "Climate fit. Args: place, temperature.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kann in %1$@ fast das ganze Jahr draußen stehen; hol sie in den kältesten Nächten unter %2$@ rein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Can spend most of the year outside in %1$@; bring it in on the coldest nights below %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede pasar casi todo el año afuera en %1$@; métela en las noches más frías, por debajo de %2$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peut passer presque toute l'année dehors à %1$@ ; rentre-la les nuits les plus froides, sous %2$@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@なら一年の大半を外で過ごせます。%2$@を下回るいちばん寒い夜は室内へ。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pode passar boa parte do ano lá fora em %1$@. Leve pra dentro nas noites abaixo de %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can you check my soil? I might be getting thirsty." : {
      "comment" : "Plant speaking in chat, request checkSoil, default voice (cheerful/any personality): warm and friendly.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prüfst du meine Erde? Ich krieg vielleicht Durst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Puedes revisar mi tierra? Creo que me está dando sed."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu peux vérifier ma terre ? Je commence peut-être à avoir soif."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土をチェックしてくれる？ そろそろのどが渇いてきたかも。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pode checar minha terra? Acho que tô ficando com sede."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can you poke my soil and tell me what you feel?" : {
      "comment" : "Plant speaking in chat, request checkSoil, curious personality: inquisitive, asks questions.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steckst du mal den Finger in meine Erde und sagst mir, wie sie sich anfühlt?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Puedes tocar mi tierra y decirme qué sientes?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu peux tâter ma terre et me dire ce que tu sens ?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土をちょんとさわって、どんな感じか教えてくれる？"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pode cutucar minha terra e me contar o que sentiu?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can you send a photo of the leaf?" : {
      "comment" : "Plant chat: asks for a photo of the leaf.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schickst du mir ein Foto vom Blatt?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Me mandas una foto de la hoja?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu peux m'envoyer une photo de la feuille ?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "葉っぱの写真を送ってくれる？"
