    "Cool and nearly dry from October to March. This is what makes many cacti flower." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Von Oktober bis März kühl und fast trocken. Genau davon blühen viele Kakteen."
          }
