        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sec : électricité statique, peau ou lèvres sèches"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乾燥：静電気、肌や唇がカサカサ"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seco: pele e lábios ressecados, choquinho ao tocar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry? Then yes, I'd love a drink. Water slowly until it runs out the bottom." : {
      "comment" : "Plant replies after the user reports how its soil feels. Plant speaks in first person; the terse one is the independent personality.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trocken? Dann ja, ich hätte gern was zu trinken. Gieß langsam, bis es unten rausläuft."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Seca? Entonces sí, me encantaría un traguito. Riega despacio hasta que salga por abajo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sèche ? Alors oui, je boirais bien un coup. Arrose doucement jusqu'à ce que ça coule par le dessous."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乾いてる？ じゃあ、お水がほしいな。鉢底から流れ出るまでゆっくりあげてね。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seca? Então sim, eu adoraria uma regadinha. Rega devagar até escorrer por baixo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dry. Water when you can." : {
      "comment" : "Plant speaking in chat, request water, independent personality: terse, dry, no-nonsense, few words.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trocken. Gieß, wenn du kannst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seca. Riega cuando puedas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sèche. Arrose quand tu peux."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乾いています。できるときにお水を。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seca. Rega quando puder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
