          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gently tease circling roots. Trim any black, mushy ones with clean scissors." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kreisende Wurzeln sanft lockern. Schwarze, matschige mit einer sauberen Schere abschneiden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desenreda con cuidado las raíces que dan vueltas. Corta las negras y blandas con tijeras limpias."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Démêle doucement les racines qui tournent en rond. Coupe celles qui sont noires et molles avec des ciseaux propres."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ぐるぐる巻いた根はそっとほぐします。黒くてブヨブヨの根は清潔なハサミで切ってね。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solte as raízes enroladas com cuidado. Corte as pretas e moles com tesoura limpa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gently wiggle off a whole, plump leaf, including its base." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dreh vorsichtig ein ganzes, pralles Blatt mitsamt Ansatz ab."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desprende con cuidado una hoja entera y gordita, con todo y su base."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Détache doucement une feuille entière et charnue, base comprise."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ふっくらした葉を、つけ根ごとそっと揺らしてはずします。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Balance com cuidado e solte uma folha inteira e gordinha, com a base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get the whole plant and a bit of its soil in the shot. I'll work out who it is, how it's doing and how to look after it." : {
      "comment" : "UI text in plant/plants/spaces screens; keep short like English",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nimm die ganze Pflanze und etwas Erde mit aufs Bild. Ich finde raus, wer sie ist, wie’s ihr geht und wie du sie pflegst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Que salga toda la planta y un poco de su tierra en la foto. Yo averiguo quién es, cómo está y cómo cuidarla."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cadre toute la plante et un peu de sa terre. Je trouverai qui c'est, comment elle va et comment t'en occuper."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "株全体と土が少し写るように撮ってね。誰なのか、元気かどうか、どうお世話すればいいか調べるよ。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fotografe a planta inteira com um pouco da terra. Eu descubro quem ela é, como está e como cuidar dela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting everyone ready before you go" : {
      "comment" : "Reminder kind subtitle in Settings, short and warm.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
