    "Got it, %@. %@ climate. I'll keep an eye on the weather there." : {
      "comment" : "Setup chat: place confirmed. Args: city, climate type name (capitalized, e.g. 'Humid subtropical')",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
