    "Healthy roots are firm and pale. Rotten ones are brown, mushy and smell. Snip those away." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gesunde Wurzeln sind fest und hell. Faule sind braun, matschig und riechen. Schneid die weg."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las raíces sanas son firmes y claras. Las podridas son cafés, blandas y huelen feo. Córtalas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Des racines saines sont fermes et claires. Les pourries sont brunes, molles et sentent mauvais. Coupe-les."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "元気な根は固くて白っぽい色。腐った根は茶色くてブヨブヨ、においもします。そこは切り取ってね。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Raiz saudável é firme e clara. Raiz podre é marrom, mole e tem cheiro ruim. Corte as podres com uma tesoura limpa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Healthy roots are firm and white or tan." : {
