    "High potassium supports flowering." : {
      "comment" : "Product scan verdict reason for one plant. Args are plant or species names, numbers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Viel Kalium fördert die Blüte."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mucho potasio ayuda a la floración."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beaucoup de potassium favorise la floraison."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カリが多いと花つきがよくなります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Potássio alto favorece a floração."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hmm, I'm not sure what you mean. You could say \"watered %@\", or just ask me anything about them." : {
      "comment" : "Jungle chat: message not understood. %@ = one or two plant names as a list. Example uses the verb 'watered' (pt: 'reguei').",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hm, ich weiß nicht genau, was du meinst. Du könntest „%@ gegossen“ sagen oder mich einfach alles über sie fragen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mmm, no estoy seguro de qué quieres decir. Puedes decir \"regué a %@\", o preguntarme lo que sea sobre ellas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hmm, je ne suis pas sûr de comprendre. Tu peux dire « arrosé %@ », ou juste me poser une question sur elles."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "うーん、ちょっとわからなかった。「%@に水やりした」みたいに言うか、なんでも聞いてみてね。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hmm, não entendi direito. Você pode falar \"reguei %@\" ou me perguntar qualquer coisa sobre elas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold each leaf from underneath with one hand." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte jedes Blatt mit einer Hand von unten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sostén cada hoja por debajo con una mano."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiens chaque feuille par en dessous d'une main."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "片手で葉を下から支えます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segure cada folha por baixo com uma mão."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold your hand a foot above the spot at midday. A crisp shadow means bright light, a soft one medium, barely any means low." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte mittags deine Hand 30 cm über die Stelle. Scharfer Schatten heißt hell, weicher heißt mittel, kaum einer heißt dunkel."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pon tu mano a 30 cm del lugar al mediodía. Una sombra nítida es luz brillante, una suave es media, y si casi no hay es poca."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiens ta main à 30 cm au-dessus de l'endroit, à midi. Une ombre nette, c'est lumineux ; floue, c'est moyen ; presque rien, c'est sombre."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お昼ごろ、その場所の30cmくらい上に手をかざしてみて。影がくっきりなら明るい、ぼんやりなら中くらい、ほとんど出ないなら暗いです。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ao meio-dia, coloque a mão uns 30 cm acima do lugar. Sombra bem nítida é luz forte, sombra suave é luz média e quase nenhuma sombra é luz fraca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds a bit more water than %@ likes." : {
      "comment" : "Product scan verdict reason for one plant. Args are plant or species names, numbers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hält etwas mehr Wasser, als %@ mag."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retiene un poco más de agua de la que le gusta a %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retient un peu plus d'eau que ce que %@ aime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@の好みより、少し水を多く保ちます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segura um pouco mais de água do que %@ gosta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds far too much water for %@. Risk of root rot." : {
      "comment" : "Product scan verdict reason for one plant. Args are plant or species names, numbers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hält viel zu viel Wasser für %@. Gefahr von Wurzelfäule."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retiene demasiada agua para %@. Riesgo de pudrir las raíces."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retient bien trop d'eau pour %@. Risque de pourriture des racines."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@には水を保ちすぎます。根腐れの危険あり。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segura água demais pra %@. Risco de apodrecer a raiz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
