    "In autumn, a few weeks of nights a few degrees cooler than days triggers a new spike." : {
      "comment" : "Care guide step instruction; warm, practical",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Im Herbst lösen ein paar Wochen mit Nächten, die ein paar Grad kühler sind als die Tage, eine neue Rispe aus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En otoño, unas semanas con noches unos grados más frescas que los días hacen que salga una vara nueva."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En automne, quelques semaines de nuits un peu plus fraîches que les journées déclenchent une nouvelle hampe."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "秋に数週間、夜を昼より数度涼しくすると、新しい花茎が出てきます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No outono, algumas semanas de noites uns graus mais frias que os dias fazem nascer uma haste nova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In my current setup I usually dry in about %lld days. I learned that from your soil checks." : {
      "comment" : "Plant chat: learned drying rhythm. %lld = days (plural).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
