    "New spot! I'll take a few weeks to adjust, so don't worry if I'm quiet." : {
      "comment" : "Plant thanks the user after care action 'move'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
