    "The pests that bother %@ most:\n%@\nCheck under my leaves and along the stems. A clear photo will help most." : {
      "comment" : "Plant chat: likely pests. Args: species common name, bulleted list of pests.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Schädlinge machen %1$@ am meisten zu schaffen:\n%2$@\nSchau unter meinen Blättern und an den Stielen nach. Ein scharfes Foto hilft am meisten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The pests that bother %1$@ most:\n%2$@\nCheck under my leaves and along the stems. A clear photo will help most."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las plagas que más molestan a %1$@:\n%2$@\nRevisa bajo mis hojas y a lo largo de los tallos. Una foto clara ayuda muchísimo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les nuisibles qui embêtent le plus %1$@ :\n%2$@\nRegarde sous mes feuilles et le long des tiges. Une photo nette aidera le plus."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@がいちばん困る害虫：\n%2$@\n葉の裏と茎をチェックしてね。はっきりした写真があるといちばん助かるよ。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As pragas que mais pegam a %1$@:\n%2$@\nDá uma olhada embaixo das minhas folhas e nos caules. Uma foto bem nítida ajuda muito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant doctor is unavailable right now. Try again later." : {
      "comment" : "AI doctor: generic failure",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
