    "Yum, thank you! I'll put it into new growth." : {
      "comment" : "Plant thanks the user after care action 'feed'. If the line is short and dry it is the independent (terse) personality; if theatrical it is the dramatic one; otherwise warm and cheerful.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mmh, danke! Das steck ich in neues Wachstum."
