          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "タンク満タン。ありがとう！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I might have %@. Thanks for starting my treatment. I'll remind you to repeat it in about 6 days, three rounds in all." : {
      "comment" : "Plant voice in chat, first person, grateful; arg pest name lowercase",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acho que tô com %@. Valeu por começar meu tratamento. Te lembro de repetir em uns 6 dias, três rodadas no total."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que tenga %@. Gracias por empezar mi tratamiento. Te recordaré repetirlo en unos 6 días, tres rondas en total."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "J'ai peut-être des %@. Merci d'avoir commencé mon traitement. Je te rappellerai de recommencer dans 6 jours environ, trois séances en tout."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vielleicht habe ich %@. Danke, dass du die Behandlung begonnen hast. Ich erinnere dich in etwa 6 Tagen ans Wiederholen, drei Runden insgesamt."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@がいるかも。処置を始めてくれてありがとう。約6日後にまたお知らせするね、全部で3回だよ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Self-watering pot: refill the reservoir once it's empty." : {
      "comment" : "Care reason for a self-watering pot.",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vaso autoirrigável: enche o reservatório quando esvaziar."
